sdk explanations
==================
every game has the sdk.js file 
the version number is in method sendSdkVersion

in the future the reability needs to the sdk version and see if it feets and if not - not start the game


in reability the file is located under the assets/sdk folder - it is not functional there but just to have acopy in our source


upload sdk
-------------
1. make the change on an updated sdk file in one of the games
2. update sdk version number under method send sdk version (put const on top)
3. replace the sdk file in reability client assets folder with the new one 
4. on every game update the new sdk 
5. after that : npm run build
6. go to s3 in every game and press Upload
7. choose everything from the dist folder under the relevant subfolder





